# API Conventions

See `docs/API_GUIDE.md`.

## Rules

- All data source methods return `TaskEither<Failure, T>` — never `Future<T>`
- Use `BaseApiClient.request()` — never raw `Dio` outside `packages/network`
- Map errors via `FailureMapper.map()` — `DioException` never leaks to features
- Response models: `fromJson` factory + `toEntity()` method
- Request models: `toJson()` → `Map<String, dynamic>`
- Pagination: `PaginatedResponse<T>` or `CursorResponse<T>` from `network`
- API paths: `abstract final class <Feature>ApiPaths`

## Naming

| Artifact | Pattern |
|----------|---------|
| DataSource | `<Feature>RemoteDataSource` / `Impl` |
| Request DTO | `<Action><Feature>Request` |
| Response DTO | `<Feature>ResponseModel` |
